{"id":"n8c2300b0a6","headline":"Government to Ensure Uninterrupted Power Supply Within 2 Years: Information Adviser","summary":"Bangladesh's information adviser said uninterrupted electricity supply can be ensured within 1.5 to 2 years. Measures include a floating LNG terminal, domestic gas exploration, full commissioning of Rooppur nuclear plant, and connecting Bhola gas to the grid.","why":"Reliable power and LNG imports are central to Bangladesh's industrial output and energy costs, which affect its economic growth.","category":"economy","event_type":"energy-supply","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Dhaka","country":"Bangladesh","lat":23.81,"lon":90.41,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"অর্থসূচক","url":"https://www.arthosuchak.com/archives/972145/%E0%A7%A8-%E0%A6%AC%E0%A6%9B%E0%A6%B0%E0%A7%87%E0%A6%B0-%E0%A6%AE%E0%A6%A7%E0%A7%8D%E0%A6%AF%E0%A7%87-%E0%A6%A8%E0%A6%BF%E0%A6%B0%E0%A6%AC%E0%A6%9A%E0%A7%8D%E0%A6%9B%E0%A6%BF%E0%A6%A8%E0%A7%8D/"},"sources":[{"name":"অর্থসূচক","url":"https://www.arthosuchak.com/archives/972145/%E0%A7%A8-%E0%A6%AC%E0%A6%9B%E0%A6%B0%E0%A7%87%E0%A6%B0-%E0%A6%AE%E0%A6%A7%E0%A7%8D%E0%A6%AF%E0%A7%87-%E0%A6%A8%E0%A6%BF%E0%A6%B0%E0%A6%AC%E0%A6%9A%E0%A7%8D%E0%A6%9B%E0%A6%BF%E0%A6%A8%E0%A7%8D/"}],"published_at":"2026-09-01T08:50:57Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-13T08:34:43Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"32ad8bfcf18a150d","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-13T08:34:43Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-01T08:50:57Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-01T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"BG","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"২ বছরের মধ্যে নিরবচ্ছিন্ন বিদ্যুৎ সরবরাহ নিশ্চিত করবে সরকার: তথ্য উপদেষ্টা","source_language":